{"meta":{"id":"class-modules","category":"aide/modules","title":"클래스 모듈","subtitle":"(Log·AI 사용량 트래커)","summary":"Log 클래스(Python/Java/PHP), AI 사용량 트래커","tags":["aide","모듈","로그","클래스"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-commands","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-300/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-200/40 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 border border-teal-200 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-600\"></span>\n      3-modules\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">aide Reusable Modules</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    클래스 모듈 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-teal-600 font-serif\">(Log·AI 사용량 트래커)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/80 border border-teal-100 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> 기능 하나가 클래스 하나로 완결되는, 언어 불문 그대로 갖다 쓰는 모듈\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-600\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">1. Log 클래스</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-3\">\n    같은 개념을 언어별로 나란히 둔다 — 셋 다 <a class=\"text-teal-700 font-semibold underline\" href=\"#/page/aide/common-rules/logging\">로그 규칙</a>(ISO 8601, 5단계, LOG_LEVEL, 날짜별 롤링)을 따른다.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[26%]\">언어</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 w-[30%]\">파일</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[44%]\">사용법</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Python</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">logger.py</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><code class=\"text-[11px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">setup_logger(log_dir, name)</code> — logging 표준 모듈 기반</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Java</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">Log.java</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><code class=\"text-[11px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">new Log(name)</code> 후 .debug()/.info()/.warning()/.error()/.critical()</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">PHP</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">LOG.Class.php</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><code class=\"text-[11px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">LOG::debug(name, msg)</code> 등 정적 메서드</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50/80 p-3\">\n    <pre class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-stone-700 font-mono overflow-x-auto\">def _resolve_level(name):\n    # LOG_LEVEL_&lt;NAME&gt;이 있으면 우선, 없으면 전역 LOG_LEVEL\n    return os.environ.get(f\"LOG_LEVEL_{name.upper()}\") or os.environ.get(\"LOG_LEVEL\", \"INFO\")\n\n# 날짜별 파일 롤링 + 콘솔 동시 출력\nlog_file = log_dir / f\"{name}_{today}.log\"</pre>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-600\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">2. AI 사용량 트래커</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">여러 AI Provider(Anthropic/OpenAI/OpenAI 호환)를 감싸는 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">AIUsageClient</code></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">호출마다 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">provider+model 단위로 토큰 사용량을 자동 기록</strong></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">생성자: <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">AIUsageClient(anthropic_api_key=, openai_api_key=, usage_file=)</code></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">사용: <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">.chat()</code>/<code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">.embed()</code> 호출 시 자동 기록, <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">.get_usage()</code>/<code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">.reset_usage()</code>로 조회/초기화</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">모듈 폴더 규칙</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">폴더 = 개념/패턴 단위, 그 안에 언어별 실제 코드 파일을 나란히 둔다 — 리프 콘텐츠가 .md가 아니라 실행 가능한 코드 파일인 게 3-modules만의 특징이다.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>aide Reusable Modules</span>\n  <span>클래스 모듈</span>\n</div>\n","path":"aide/modules/class-modules","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"modules","title":"3-modules (재사용 모듈)","path":"aide/modules"}],"hasImage":false}